---
import Notes from "@pres/components/Notes.astro";
import ComicLayout from "@pres/components/ComicLayout.astro";
import comic1 from "./assets/comic-1.jpg";
import comic2 from "./assets/comic-2.jpg";
import comic3 from "./assets/comic-3.jpg";
import comic4 from "./assets/comic-4.jpg";
export const meta = {"title":"ComicLayout · 四格漫画","steps":4};
---

<ComicLayout
  title="ComicLayout · 四格漫画"
  panels={[
    { image: comic1, alt: "第一格", caption: { text: "每格可配 caption", position: "tl" } },
    { image: comic2, alt: "第二格", caption: { text: "按 → 逐格淡入", position: "bl" } },
    { image: comic3, alt: "第三格", caption: { text: "step 默认 = 序号", position: "bl" } },
    { image: comic4, alt: "第四格", caption: [
      { text: "caption 支持数组多行", position: "bl" },
      { text: "position 九宫格可选", position: "tr" },
    ] },
  ]}
/>

<Notes>

ComicLayout：2×2 漫画格。panels 按左到右、上到下排列；每格 step 默认为序号（从 1 起），也可用 panel.step 覆盖；effect 默认 fade，可逐格指定。

</Notes>
